Return the destination to receive messages from. Will be <code>null</code>
if the configured destination is not an actual <code>Destination</code> type;
c.f. <a href="#setDestinationName(java.lang.String)"><code>when the destination is a String</code></a>.

Return whether the Publish/Subscribe domain (<code>Topics</code>) is used
for replies. Otherwise, the Point-to-Point domain (<code>Queues</code>)
is used.
